  "id": "complementary-class",
  "term": "complementary class",
  "definition": "In this context, a complementary class is an additional category of treatment target considered alongside the main ones already emphasized. Here it refers to neuroplasticity and synaptic mechanisms as another target class intended to help normalize synapse function and support cognition in Alzheimer’s disease and related neurodegenerative disorders.",
